        "reading_checked": "If the blue line is the new-tourist series, the horizontal year ticks bind its endpoints to 1880 and 1891, and higher vertical position maps to a larger number of tourists, then the relative endpoint positions indicate net change across the review period. If routing is based on net growth, a positive net change maps to growth planning.",
